/*
 * 4-machine STAR (claw, center=1) topology stability region. {H < 4K} positively invariant
 * for ALL D1..D4,K>0. FORMAL content: only '{H<c} invariant' (dI uses H non-
 * increasing, holds for any c). NUMERICAL (fsolve, not formalized): this graph's
 * lowest saddle = 4K (vs chain 4K, ring 8K, K4 12K) -- the displayed constant.
